		<name>Recipes</name>
		<summary>Cook from clear steps with timers, from the Interactive Recipe Reader</summary>
		<desc>The Android app for the Interactive Recipe Reader, which turns recipes into clear steps with
the ingredients highlighted and a timer for each step.

* Opens recipe links from other apps and the browser
* Scans invite and login QR codes
* Adds scheduled recipes to the calendar
* Keeps the screen on while you cook

The app shows the reader's server, so new features mostly arrive without an update.</desc>
